	(text "3V3_D comes from Waveshare H4 VCC (jumper H3 = 3V3).\n3V3_A = 3V3_D via ferrite FB1.\nAGND ties to GND at R1 only, near the ADS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152 66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dcb3a2fb-a9c8-4024-ae38-fbb53b1f36ed")
	)
	(text "H4 pin order: 1 VIN, 2 GND, 3 A, 4 B, 5 CANL NC, 6 CANH NC,\n7 VCC, 8 GND, 9 SDA, 10 SCL.\nWaveshare already pulls up I2C with 4.7k; R2/R3 DNP.\nSet Waveshare SW1 RS485 termination ON.\nJ11 = VFD Modbus pass-through, J5 = I2C debug header."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 297 62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e1f6e1f7-055a-4230-86ef-8a2b7c0c5a16")
	)
	(text "Ch A NTC1 rotor trips ~110 C (fw 105).\nCh B NTC3 motor trips ~140 C (fw 130).\n10M hysteresis ~3 K.\nOpen-collector wired-AND -> TEMP_OK (high = OK)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100 258 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e811308c-b5b0-4bfa-9ef0-381915b1a3ed")
	)
